# data file for fldtk fluid (Fast Light User Interface Designer)
version 1.0000
Function {closeTabCB(Widget o)}
  {
    comment {Shared by every closeable tab page (Fl_Tabs' own "x" close
button) -- FLTK hoists this as one shared static function too,
just via Fluid's own duplicate-callback-text dedup, not a named
Function. Also reused directly (as a bare delegate) by the "add tab"
button below for tabs it creates at runtime.}
    return_type void
    open
  }
  {
    code {if (fl.core.callbackReason() == CallbackReason.closed)
  (cast(FlGroup) o.parent()).remove(o);}
      {
      }
  }
Function {}
  {
    open
  }
  {
    Window fooWindow
      {
